{"event":"result","result":{"conversation_id":"b9c1fee1-9839-49f9-bb30-ca5d8049a62c","status":"SUCCESS","response":"The Intervals.icu OAuth integration has been fixed, and the root causes and analysis have been documented in [ANSWER.md](file:///tmp/h-p3CWRz/ANSWER.md).\n\n### Summary of Fixes\n\n1. **OAuth Init via POST**:\n   - Converted `/api/intervals/auth/init` in [server.py](file:///tmp/h-p3CWRz/server.py) from a `GET` redirect endpoint to an authenticated `POST` endpoint returning `{\"authorize_url\": ...}`.\n   - Updated the Connect button in [static/app.js](file:///tmp/h-p3CWRz/static/app.js) to trigger an authenticated `POST` fetch call (sending `Authorization: Bearer \u003ctoken\u003e`) and navigate using `window.location.assign(res.authorize_url)`.\n\n2. **Duplicate Scope Resolution**:\n   - Fixed `SCOPES` in [config.py](file:///tmp/h-p3CWRz/config.py) from `\"ACTIVITY:READ,ACTIVITY:WRITE,WELLNESS:READ,CALENDAR:READ,CALENDAR:WRITE\"` to `\"ACTIVITY:WRITE,WELLNESS:READ,CALENDAR:WRITE\"`. In Intervals.icu, `:WRITE` implies `:READ`, and duplicating areas causes an HTTP 400 error.\n\n3. **Perpetual Token Lifecycle \u0026 Lazy 401 Revocation**:\n   - Removed the default 1-hour expiration assumption and the background `refresh_tokens` loop in [server.py](file:///tmp/h-p3CWRz/server.py) since Intervals.icu tokens do not expire or supply refresh tokens.\n   - Added lazy handling on HTTP 401 responses in `/api/intervals/wellness` to transition the status to `\"expired, reconnect\"`.\n\n4. **Token Exchange \u0026 Account Mismatch Guard**:\n   - Streamlined `exchange_code` in [server.py](file:///tmp/h-p3CWRz/server.py) to send only `client_id`, `client_secret`, and `code`.\n   - Added an athlete ID check in `store_connection` to guard against account mismatches on reconnection.\n","duration_seconds":136.160965,"num_turns":1,"usage":{"input_tokens":232590,"output_tokens":7084,"thinking_tokens":0,"cache_read_tokens":804426,"total_tokens":239674}}}
